meta {
  name: Ask Question
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "question": "What is this document about?"
  }
}

docs {
  Steps 8 to 11. The question is turned into an embedding, the closest chunks in this workspace
  are found, and the local model writes an answer from them. "sources" shows the file and page
  of every chunk that was used. The first answer is slow while Ollama loads the model.
}
